window.products.push({"id":535040,"name":"Sauder Homeplus Base Cabinet, Sienna Oak Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PgFv25kEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Storage space is a must - contain the clutter and chaos in your home with this base cabinet from the HomePlus collection. Behind its framed panel doors is a hidden storage area that includes a large adjustable shelf that has the ability to move to different heights, giving you flexible options to create space for items of all shapes and sizes. Its spacious top surface also makes a great place to store and display home décor and miscellaneous household items. It can be stacked up to two high to create a custom storage solution. Other features include adjustable base levelers and cord access through the enclosed back panel. Its simple design and attractive style make this cabinet a great addition to any room in your home – the utility room, in the living room, down the hallway or even in the bedroom. This storage cabinet gives your home the look you want with the functionality you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PgFv25kEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sauder","source_asin":"B0BBKH34LJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBKH34LJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBKH34LJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":535041,"name":"Personalized Christmas Stocking Flag Fish Custom Name Socks Xmas Tree Fireplace Hanging Party Decor Gift 17.52 x 7.87 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bdD3ZaG7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Every christmas, children are looking forward to santa claus, they hang their christmas stockings beside the fireplace or their beds and believe that santa claus will slide down the chimney, and he will put presents in their christmas stockings. We havemany other christmas stockings for you to choose from. With the fantastic designed stockings, making your family have a nice christmas. This large christmas stockings measures 44.5cm(17.52'') from top to toe. The width size is 19.98cm (7.87''). There is a large top opening and a spacious interior space, It has enough space for gifts putting, nice for you to fill candies or chocolates,watch,folding wallet,ties,gift cards,small toy cars, etc, and also the large size more good for hanging decoration.Really exciting! Hand wash best, machine wash in a gentle cycle with a neutral detergent, lay flat to dry, don't bleach. These christmas stockings are a good christmas gift for family members, friends and neighbors; suitable for the decorating homes, firelace, restaurants, hotels, clubs, bars and other places during the christmas season, to increase the warm atmosphere of festival.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bdD3ZaG7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XOZOTY","source_asin":"B09CYZKPYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CYZKPYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CYZKPYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":535042,"name":"artgeist Glass Wall Art Acrylic Print Flowers 47x16 in - Image Picture Photo Painting Artwork 1 pcs Home Decor Poppy b-C-0157-k-a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Vpr4PqyML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Acrylic glass print is a very interesting alternative to traditional pieces of decoration. It's also a perfect addition to almost all types of interior designs.Hangers and pads placed on the back side allow you to hang the picture without any difficulties. When the picture is already on the wall, there's space between the item and the surface, so it creats an additional 3D impression.Modern print techniques and high quality inks will catch every eye. The surface of the picture is humidity-resistant, so it's also easy to clean.If the picture consists of more than 1 part, please make sure there is 2-3 cm distance between the panels so that the pattern matches up well. All our products belong to the Artgeist.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Vpr4PqyML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"artgeist","source_asin":"B07QS3WFS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535042","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QS3WFS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QS3WFS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
