window.products.push({"id":535206,"name":"pigchcy Round Braided Placemats Washable Easy to Clean Round Placemats Set of 4 Table Mats for Dining Tables 15 inch (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bUDM9zmBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Welcome PIGCHCY! When you eat regularly, the desktop will be a mess. Fortunately, there is now a PIGCHCY placemat that will protect your table or bar from the wear and tear of tableware! Not only do they protect tabletops anywhere they're put, but they're also stylish and seasonal, doubling as eye-catching kitchen or dining table decorations! They look more luxurious and more comfortable to use. I believe that the PIGCHCY placemat is an integral part of your table. More than just a placemat for the kitchen! - Comfortable – Imitation cotton and linen material, soft and comfortable, foldable without any trace - Breathable&Hypoallergenic – Our placemats are woven, have good breathability, and are environmentally friendly materials. They are the gospel of allergic people. - Both indoors and outdoors Suitable for, but not limited to, restaurants, cafes, desks, living rooms, coffee tables, etc. Even you can use it in the drawer of the table. - Gifts - Great gift idea for all occasions, Christmas, Wedding, Fathers Day, Mothers Day, Valentines, Thanksgiving. Precautions Can be rolled up to save space when not in use 1、Wash with warm water and a mild detergent. It can be cleaned with a soft brush. 2、If you accidentally leave the sauce such as ketchup on the placemat, first wipe it with a paper towel and rinse it out after use. 3、If the placemat has creases, soak it in warm water (40~50°C) for 10 to 15 minutes, remove it, and lay it on the table. If necessary, place a heavy object on the placemat for half an hour.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bUDM9zmBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PIGCHCY","source_asin":"B09SYZ1M51","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SYZ1M51","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SYZ1M51","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
