window.products.push({"id":535214,"name":"HOMOW Nonstick Bakeware Springform Pan,Cake Pan, Cheesecakes Pan (9\" X 9\" X 2.5)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G5lSG5E9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This springform pans makes it easy to create delicious cheesecakes, as well as other special desserts like layer cakes and tortes. The pan is made by special heavy duty carbon steel and characterized by high hardness and super endurance. Premium Whitford non-stick coating perfect demoulding. How to use - Wash before first use in warm. soapy water and dry thoroughly. - Metal and sharp kitchen tools should not be used as they may damage the non-stick coating. Wooden rubber heat-resistant nylon or plastic tools will be a good choice when baking. - Ensure product has cooled down around ten minutes prior to cleaning. - Never use heat above 450℉ and no any acidic food allowed when baking. - Do not place the product over direct heat or gas flame for a long time. Otherwise cake mold will be damaged. - Clean by dishwasher or hand washing with degertent. Do not use metal scourers or harsh abraasives to remove burnt-on food left in the pan. leave a soak for a few minutes in hot. Soapy water before starting to clean. Dry it by cloth or kitchen paper towel before storing. - This product is only suitable for oven. Please do not use it in microwave oven, electromagnetic oven or gas stove.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G5lSG5E9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMOW","source_asin":"B06XKG1PR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XKG1PR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XKG1PR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":535215,"name":"Rechargeable Electric Can Opener: Open Cans with A Simple Push of Button - Smooth Edge, Food-Safe, Automatic Handheld Can Opener for Seniors with Arth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qI81frpSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Rechargeable Electric Can Opener】The new can opener can be recharged and recycle to use, the 1000mAh capacity battery makes sure for working continuously for 2 hours. It saves you the cost of batteries and reduces environmental pollution. 【Can Opener Smooth Edge】Electric can opener blade automatically cuts along the side of the lid without touching the food inside. No sharp cuts are leaved, more safer than with a manual can opener. 【One-Button Switch Can Opener】Open your cans with a simple push of button with our electric can opener to get your hands free. It cuts 360° along the lid. Push the button again to stop. The magnets on the back can immediately absorb the cutted iron lid without getting your hands dirty. 【Suitable for Seniors with Arthritis】User-friendly design of our automatic can opener has an ergonomic knob, easy to rotate, and is safe to cut, help you open cans effortlessly. It is good friend for elderly suffering from arthritis. 【Good Partner for Cans】This can cutter opener is suitable for most size of round cans and oval cans. Reduce your busyness and injury in the kitchen and save time. The electric can opener is a surprise gift for the elderly, mums, friends, and person with arthritis.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qI81frpSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dong7Niu","source_asin":"B0BWTQ1HWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWTQ1HWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWTQ1HWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
