window.products.push({"id":535287,"name":"Godmorn Steamer Basket Stainless Steel for Instant Pot and Pressure Cooker, Folding Steamer Insert for Veggie Fish Seafood Cooking, Expandable Collaps","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Th9co6lyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When to Use a Steamer Basket in an Instant Pot Any good recipe will tell you exactly when to use a steamer basket.Mothers who want to steam their baby's food,such as steamed carrots for making baby puree.Let's try to learn it.❤ Eggs: Because they're so delicate, eggs benefit from being placed in a steamer basket in the Instant Pot. Since the eggs aren't resting directly against the insert, they're less likely to be jostled or damaged during cooking. ❤ Tough or firm vegetables: It is able to steam the broccoli and carrots without loosing all the nutrients. Instead of boiling veggies in water.This is especially important when making potatoes.❤ Meatloaf, whole chicken, and other meats: Using a steamer basket or rack to elevate meatloaf and whole chicken is a smart solution to prevent the food from getting soggy. ❤ Bread and cakes: You can even make things like bread and cheesecake in your Instant Pot, but do cook them on a steamer basket so they're not resting in the water at the bottom of the insert. Why choose Godmorn Steamer Basket: -☛ High quality food grade material--430 stainless steel.-☛ The basket collapses for compact storage and expands to fit pots.-☛ The handle extends and locks into place for filling and transporting and retracts to fit inside your favorite pots or pressure cookers. -☛ Foldable feet elevate steamer 0.9 -1.5 inches above water for quick and effective steaming. -☛ Silicone feet will not scratch your pot.-☛ Neatly distributed filter holes, food steaming time 3 times faster. Can Serve As ✪ for steaming variety of foods. Steam retaining flavor and nutrients.✪ can be used as container or candy plate.✪ can be used as drain rack.✪ can be used as food dust cover. Package Included: Medium one: collapsed diameter 5.5\" Large one:collapsed diameter 7.1\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Th9co6lyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Godmorn","source_asin":"B075ZTH56T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075ZTH56T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075ZTH56T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
