window.products.push({"id":535305,"name":"LV-H132 Replacement Filter for LEVOIT Air Purifier Replacement Filter LV-H132-RF, 3-in-1 H13 True HEPA Filter Replacement, 3 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HwT8MgscL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【COMPATIBLE MODELS】- ①The premium air purifier filter replacement is specfically designed compatible with LEVOIT LV-H132 Air Purifier. Part # LV-H132-RF. ② NOTE: This is not a OEM Filter. Any use of the brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. Feel free to ask us if you have any questions, we will unconditionally provide satisfying after-sales service ❤【3-STAGE HEPA FILTRATION】- Our LV-H132 replacement filter is specifically designed in 3-in-1 H13 True HEPA Filtration System to guarantee the best performance for your air purifier: ①Nylon Preliminary Filter traps hair, pet fur, and lint etc. ②H13 Grade True HEPA Filter captures 99.97% of suspended down to 0.3 microns in size ③Activated Carbon Filter absorbs household odors from pets, cooking, smoking and wildfire ❤【SUPER CRAFT】- Our H13 true hepa filter replacement is made of high quality non-woven fabric and activated carbon well-tested by the manufacturer, with higher efficiency and less pressure to ensure maximum filtration. And the upgraded electrostatic electret filter technology which used in hepa filter ensures energy saving and a longer service life ❤【EXCELLENT FILTRATION】- Our filter combined with H13 True HEPA Filtration System is capable of attaching 99.7% of the suspended as small as 0.3 microns, and the activated carbon filter helps absorb unpleasant odors and gases. It's the ideal and perfect air purifier filter for those who are sensitive to the surrounding air quality ❤【COST-EFFECTIVE GOODS】- Package includes 3 x LV-H132 Replacement Filter. Size: 7.5 x 7.5 x 2.4 inches (Please refer to the picture for details). Our LV-H132-RF replacement filter contains all the required parts to complete the standard installation of your LV-H132 air purifier to keep your air purifier at its best working condition and capacity ❤【REPLACEMENT RECYCLE】- We recommend you to replace the filters every 3-6 months for optimal performance (depending upon your usage and environment). It is fairly easy to install the filter, no tools required. Simply take out and replace from your machine unit when needed ❤【SHOP WITH CONFIDENCE】- Funmit adhere to provide all customers with a simple, streamlined shopping experience of large appliance replacement parts, and prove that we have the highest quality parts and service out there. We stand by our products, and our customers are our focus as a business. If you have any quality problem, please contact Funmit customer service team in time, and we will try our best to solve your problems","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HwT8MgscL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funmit","source_asin":"B0B631LMNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B631LMNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B631LMNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
