window.products.push({"id":535403,"name":"Tovala Gen 1 Smart Steam Oven with Automatic Multi-Mode Cooking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Nj1ypTzFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Tovala Steam Oven with Tovala IQ, the only app-enabled steam oven with a brain. Tovala IQ means professional chef expertise is built right in, letting you cook on autopilot. The Tovala Steam Oven is a countertop, WiFi-connected oven that pairs with Tovala’s free mobile app for versatile and effortless home cooking. The Tovala Steam Oven lets you cook like a chef—thanks to its professional-grade features with 5 different cooking modes: steaming, baking, broiling, reheating, and toasting. Combine convection baking and steam to make juicy meat, tender fish, and vibrant veggies. Bake more evenly and efficiently than a convection bake oven—with half the normal preheat time. Broil on hi or lo to use radiant heat to give food the perfect browning. Bring leftovers back to life with a chef-perfected reheat cycle of steaming, baking, and broiling. Toast with 5 settings that use steam to make you the best toast you've ever had. From the Tovala App, you can access dinner, breakfast, and kids’ recipes created by our chefs, prepped easily by you with groceries at home, and cooked automatically in your Tovala with perfect results every time. Say goodbye to your old toaster oven. The future of home cooking is here. When you're too busy and don't have time to cook, use Tovala Meals to make a healthy dinner with no prep and no cleanup (companion meal delivery service sold separately in 48 contiguous states). Prepped by professional chefs, Tovala Meals are delivered weekly. All you have to do is scan the meal's barcode and let the Tovala Steam Oven cook your dinner to perfection. In 20 minutes or less, you'll enjoy a home-cooked meal without any of the work!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Nj1ypTzFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovala","source_asin":"B07CX5GPG8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CX5GPG8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CX5GPG8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
