window.products.push({"id":535471,"name":"20\"x20\" Buffalo Check, Black & Cream Pillowcase (Pattern on Both Sides) - 100% Cotton - Throw Pillows Best for Couch, Accent Pillows, or Decorative Pi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816gVpFquUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you know someone who's home looks as if it were taken right from the pages of a magazine? Their interior design is full of life and flair, right down to the accents, contrasts, and details in the throw pillows of their living room, bed room, and patio. Can you imagine your home with the same style and charm? It's really not that difficult to infuse flair to a dull or lifeless room, with these popular and trendy couch pillows! - PATTERN IS ON BOTH SIDES - unlike most other accent pillows, whose pattern is only on one side, resulting in a MUCH more appealing and captivating visual effect! - MADE FOR AESTHETICS - the fabric is meticulously cut and sewn for aesthetics, NOT fabric efficiency . Rather than cutting for 'Fabric Efficiency', which typically ends up with the pillow showing a random portion of the pattern, and the colors, composition, and balance of the design not being as pleasing or what you expected.Our accent pillows are manufactured by cutting the fabric so that the best part of the pattern is displayed on the pillow. This is done for BOTH sides of the throw pillow case. - PROFESSIONALLY SEWN - all of our couch pillows are manufactured by professional sewers earning competitive wages in a clean environment. We do NOT manufacture any of our pillowcases overseas in sweat shops. - CONCEALED ZIPPER - a high quality YKK zipper is color matched to your throw pillows, and concealed for a clean-cut and refined look. - SERGED EDGES - all inside seams of these exquisite throw pillows are reinforced for machine washing, and to prevent fraying and ensure durability. A clear nylon thread is used so it's as discreet and aesthetically pleasing as possible. Pillow case only. Insert is NOT included. If you are seeking relaxed sophistication, with a delicate texture, to add elegance, charm, and grace to your home...this may be exactly what you've been searching for.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816gVpFquUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inspired Home Living","source_asin":"B07BSZ5RFD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BSZ5RFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BSZ5RFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
