window.products.push({"id":535508,"name":"WeGuard Pastry Mat Non-stick 24 by 16 inch for Kneading Rolling Dough Non-slip Silicone Pastry Mat Board Food Grade Baking Mat Counter Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JR9zdTRVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Non-stick, Non-slip, Fuss-free, Platinum-grade Silicone Pastry Mat: The nonstick material effortlessly releases sticky dough yet won’t slip around while protecting counter top. It is easy to take out out pie crust or biscuit dough with this pastry mat after rolling or kneading. At the same time, its nature will ensures the pastry mat will stick to the counter top firmly and never shift. Super Easy to Use or Clean: This silicone pastry mat will save you from cleaning counter top after cooking/baking. Non-stick silicone make it super easy to be cleaned up. This silicone baking mat is dishwasher washable and can be stored folded or rolled up. Dishwasher washable, heat safe up to 550℉. Diameter Guides & Rulers: No need for eyeballing—this dough mat has built-in measurement markers. Simply follow the markings on the pastry mat and you will get a prefect pie crust or biscuit dough. (with both inches or centimeters) 24 by 16 inch, Counter Top Protector or Counter Top Mat:Non-slip design grip to counter, easy to peel off. The features of water-proof and heat resistant are ideal for protecting counter top, can be used as a counter top protector. Durable and Safe, Platinum-grade Silicone: Made of food-grade silicone, this pastry mat has advantages of aging resistance, no deformation, long service life. Enjoy your peaceful baking time with this non-stick pastry mat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JR9zdTRVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WeGuard","source_asin":"B0B73J7G3T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B73J7G3T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B73J7G3T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
