window.products.push({"id":535517,"name":"Tefal Jamie Oliver Italian Series Grill Pan Aluminium Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":92.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G4OP6MR2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Here are the hints for pots and pans. Cleaning tip: Clean your cookware with hot water, liquid detergent and a soft sponge. Do not use scouring cream, steel wool and scouring pads. In the case of enamelled cookware outside, discolouration of the enamelling due to cleaning in the dishwasher is normal. On exterior hard-anodised cookware, an additional coating is applied to protect the exterior of the cookware from damage by rinsing in the dishwasher. To preserve this protective coating, do not clean the cookware with a scouring pad while rinsing by hand. If this happens, Tefal recommend rinsing the cookware only by hand, as the coating may be damaged. Caution: Cleaning in the dishwasher: various dishwashing detergents contain ingredients that can affect the non-stick properties and enamel fading of the cookware, especially with aluminium cookware. When used in the oven: Tefal cookware with handles made of stainless steel, with / without silicone insert is oven safe up to 260 °C. Tefal cookware with handles made of thermoplastic material is oven-proof up to 180 °C. In order to avoid burns, the use of oven gloves is recommended, both when used on the stove and when removing it from the oven. Tefal cookware can not be used in the microwave. Beware of children in the kitchen! Set Contains: Tefal Jamie Oliver Italian Series E21741 Grill Pan 23 x 27 cm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G4OP6MR2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tefal","source_asin":"B07GNFM1QB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GNFM1QB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GNFM1QB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
