window.products.push({"id":535522,"name":"Pumpkin-Carving-Kit,Halloween-Decorations-Pumpkin-Carving-Tools with Stencils for Kids Adults Family DIY,11PCS Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Pumpkin Carv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IzoOaEkcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Halloween Pumpkin Carving Kit 11PCS】This pumpkin carving kit cover 1x Pumpkin Scoop, 1x V-cutter, 9x Carving Stencils for Pumpkins. Pumpkin carving tools are made of food-grade stainless steel materials, which are very strong and durable after being thickened and upgraded. The handle of the pumpkin carving tool is made of thick plastic material, which conforms to the ergonomics design and feels comfortable for your hands 【Easily to Make Funny Halloween Pumpkins】Halloween pumpkin carving kit to make your pumpkin look scary and funny! Push the pumpkin carving stencils into the pumpkin where you want it to be, then remove excess pumpkin debris and use tools to carve interesting and funny faces into the Pumpkin. Different Halloween carving stencils can be used to create the various Halloween pumpkins expressions you want. Cool and funny Halloween with your family 【Very Easy to Clean and Cut】 Halloween Pumpkin carving set can be washed after make Halloween Pumpkin, will not rust. Rinse with water and wipe with a cloth to clean and store the molds. Professional pumpkin carving tools are not easily deformed and damaged. This pumpkin carving kit with stencils can work for each of your Halloween pumpkin lanterns with patterns 【Funny Pumpkin Carving Tools for Kids】 Halloween pumpkin tools and molds are suitable for all ages. Children and adults are safe to use and also suitable for beginners or experts in engraving. Use with care when carving Halloween pumpkin. Allow you to cooperate with your families and friends in this Halloween, enjoy the happy Halloween pumpkin carving time 【DIY Halloween Pumpkin Carving Tools】 This pumpkin carving set of carving tools comes in a beautiful Halloween packaging gift box. Let's make scary and funny pumpkin lanterns with your family and friends to welcome Halloween! All kinds of funny and scary pumpkin lanterns can be made quickly through this carving set with stencils","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IzoOaEkcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOBLIGOAL","source_asin":"B097YGL2PQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097YGL2PQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097YGL2PQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":535523,"name":"Gas Range Oven Stove Ignitor Igniter for Kenmore 316489402","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5176kL-PfxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SPECS:This igniter's amperage range is 3.3 - 3.6. Used with 3.2 to 3.5 amp rated gas safety valves.  Includes: high temperature stainless steel shield high temperature MGT wire leads and high temperature ceramic wire nuts to wire into harness. Replaces long and short ignitors. Be careful not to drop your new ignitor; ignitors are fragile and will break easily. FOR BRANDS:Frigidaire Electrolux Franklin Gibson White-Westinghouse Westinghouse Tappan Kelvinator Sears Kenmore DESCRIPTION:The oven igniter, also called a glow bar, heats up the bimetal switch and causes the oven to ignite the gas fed to the burners. A common issue when the oven fails to ignite is a faulty glow bar. If the oven does not start within 90 seconds, the glow bar is likely the issue. Do not be fooled if the glow bar turns red. If it does not reach the appropriate temperature, the oven will not light. If your ignitor uses a connector on the end, reuse the connector from the old ignitor. Use your wire cutters to cut the wires on the old ignitor several inches above the connector. Strip the ends of the wires with a wire stripper. Place the end of a wire on the connector next to the end of a wire on your new ignitor. Use a ceramic wire nut to twist and hold the wires together. Your wires are not color coded, so it does not matter which wires are connected together. Your old ignitor can get very hot even if it doesn't ignite the burner tube. REPLACES PART NUMBERS: 316489402 316119301, Also replacement for AP3963555, PS1528536","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5176kL-PfxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eagleggo","source_asin":"B0777MM2V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535523","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0777MM2V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0777MM2V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":535524,"name":"Ice Cube Trays Silicone Set of 2, Ice Ball Maker Mold, Whiskey Ice Ball Mold, Round Ice Cube Mold, Sphere Ice Cube Mold - Square Large Ice Cube Trays ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618PXPIZMkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you like to keep your drinks cool but don’t have an ice maker, odds are you need an ice tray. It’s likely that at some point or another, all of us have owned a cheap, plastic version that snapped in half amid twisting and turning to extract at least one measly cube to chill lukewarm water. Those days are over. With our durable, easy-release ice sphere tray, you no longer have to worry about damaging your tray or compromising the integrity of the cubes inside. With no-transfer materials, you can even meal prep without worrying about today’s iced coffee tasting like last week’s baby food. Easy to fill, easy to use! This ice sphere tray creates 1.8-inch ice blocks using durable, fade-resistant silicone that lasts through many freezing cycles without becoming discolored or brittle. The silicone material makes it easy to remove as few cubes as you want at one time without a fight. Just push up on the bottom of each compartment to pop out an ice block. Some of the amazing features of this product: 🥃Top-quality silicone ice mold with lid; 🥃Beautiful effect; 🥃Durable and resistant; 🥃Food-grade and safe; 🥃Easy ice release; 🥃Perfect to add in liquor, whiskey, cocktails, iced cold coffees, lemonade; 🥃BPA-free; 🥃Safe for dishwasher, oven, freezer, microwave; 🥃Large ice balls; 🥃Non-toxic and odorless; 🥃Temperature-resistant; 🥃Can be used for baby food, popsicles, juice, creams; 🥃Non-stick surface; 🥃Easy to clean and reusable. Enjoy your favorite beverage with our round ice balls!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618PXPIZMkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BNA","source_asin":"B091XWQLNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091XWQLNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091XWQLNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
