window.products.push({"id":535613,"name":"Now Designs Stacking Mugs, Flower Ikat, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711P1Xboe5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring works of art to your table in the form of these elegantly patterned mugs. Serve hot tea or coffee in this set of matching mugs, each bearing motifs inspired by Moroccan tiles. Gorgeous white and blue glazes cover the embossed ikat design. Set includes 6 matching mugs (stackable), each with a generous 15 ounce capacity. Made from stoneware, microwave and dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711P1Xboe5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B00QKSXWRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QKSXWRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QKSXWRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":535614,"name":"EMOOR 7-Piece Complete Japanese Floor Futon Set with Storage Bag (Comforter, Mattress, Pillow, 3 Covers & Storage Bag) First-Set, Twin Long Size, Ford","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eMU8uUyTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[PRODUCT INFORMATION] Japanese Twin Long Size. Comforter: 59x83in (150x210cm) 8 loops to attach cover. Mattress: 39x83in (100x210cm) 3-layered sandwich structure. Pillow: 17x25in (43x63cm) Outer fabric: 100% polyester. Inner filling: 100% polyester. Fitted sheet:39x81x4 in(100×205×10cm) easy to use on mattress. Comforter covering: 150×210cm 59x83in (150x210cm) with 8 strings. Pillow case: 16.9x24.8in (43×63cm). Storage bag: 39x26x10in (99×67×25cm) nonwoven fabric [READY TO USE UPON ARRIVAL] EMOOR's FIRST-SET comes with a complete Japanese bedding set with a mattress (Shikibuton), a comforter (Kakebuton), a pillow (Makura), three covers for each item, and Storage Bag. All pieces of set conveniently complement each other to produce a complete and comfortable sleeping space. [3-LAYERED STRUCTURE MATTRESS] Firm pad in the middle is sandwiched by separately-quilted soft fiberfill pads on top & bottom. This SOFT-FIRM-SOFT layered structure is a core identity of EMOOR’s futon mattress. Looks fluffy but gives firm support. [3-SEASON COMFORTER] A well-filled fluffy comforter is for fall-winter-spring. In summer we recommend \"towelket\" (Japanese summer blankets made of toweling) instead. In a cold region or mid-winter add a blanket. [FLOOR SLEEPING LIFE WITH JAPANESE FUTON] Japanese Futon setups do not need a bed platform. Mattress can be folded in three and put aside in the closet or corner, and use your room spacious during the day. Perfect for minimalists, guest-use frequent movers, or　borders to save up money and room space. [HOW TO CARE] Recommend to wash the covers regularly with laundry nets. Comforter is washable as well with laundry nets. Dry mattress and pillow under the sun on sunny days or in a well-ventilated room regularly to keep your bed dry and clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eMU8uUyTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EMOOR","source_asin":"B08ZSGPTP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZSGPTP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZSGPTP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":535615,"name":"Tilia FoodSaver Professional II Vacuum Sealing Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317B3BG70AL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Equip your kitchen with the original home vacuum packaging system. The Tilia Professional Food Saver removes air and seals in freshness. Use it to vacuum-seal bags, canisters, jars, cans and bottles, expanding the types of foods you can keep fresh 3-5 times longer. Go right from the fridge to the microwave or stove, so you enjoy economical, homemade meals even when you have no time to cook. Snacks, baking supplies and fragile foods stay fresher longer. You can even use it speed up the absorption of marinade and to prevent freezer burn. Great for non-food uses as well, like keeping supplies clean or dry or preventing metal from tarnishing. Includes 3 quart-size Food Saver bags, 2 gallon-size Food Saver bags, one 11\" Food Saver roll for creating bags, 1-1/2-qt. Food Saver canister, 5-1/2\" Food Saver universal lid, Food Saver bottle stopper, user manual and how-to video. Amazon.com Ingenious and simple to operate, Tilia's FoodSaver system seals food inside containers after vacuuming out the air--and the oxygen that causes foods to spoil. That means food stays fresh longer than when it's merely refrigerated or frozen. Meat, for example, remains good in the freezer for about six months; frozen inside a vacuum package, it remains good for two to three years--and it doesn't suffer freezer burn, either. Fish, coffee, cheese, crackers, sugar, nuts, oils, and wine all stay fresh three to five times longer when stored in a vacuum, whether they're frozen, refrigerated, or at room temperature. Also, silverware and other metal items won't tarnish when stored in a vacuum-sealed bag. This is Tilia's biggest FoodSaver machine, ideal for packaging large quantities at once. Like all FoodSaver machines, this one vacuums air from containers and seals bags with a simple one-touch operation. It has a manual sealing button for partial air removal and a sealing-time adjustment switch. The machine measures 21 by 6-1/2 by 3 inches, weighs 9 pounds, has a cord-storage compartment, and cleans easily with a damp, soapy cloth. It carries a one-year warranty against defects. An instruction booklet and video accompany the machine. The basic FoodSaver container is Tilia's three-layer VacLoc bag: it has two plastic layers and an outer nylon layer to keep moist foods (such as meat loaf or chocolate cake) moist, dry foods (such as brown sugar or flour) dry, and all foods from leaking odor. Included in this kit are three quart size bags, and two gallon bags, covering many needs. For cooking, the bags can go directly into a microwave oven or boiling water. They're resealable, reusable, and dishwasher-safe. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317B3BG70AL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOODSAVER","source_asin":"B00004Y2RM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004Y2RM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004Y2RM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
