window.products.push({"id":535625,"name":"XDOVET Leaf Blowers, 6-Speed 20V Cordless Leaf Blower, 340CFM Electric Leaf Blower Cordless, 130MPH Rechargeable Leaf Blower for Lawn Care with 2.0Ah ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oYsnR-tkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍[130MPH POWERFUL TURBINE TECH MOTOR] This XDOVET cordless leaf blower uses a turbine design similar to the aircraft propeller, with strong power that wind speed can reach up to 130MPH, and the air volume can reach up to 340CFM. No matter the garden in spring, lawn in summer, fallen leaves in autumn, or falling snow in winter, there is no need to worry, XDOVET cordless leaf blower can help you blow them away and give you a tidy home. 👍[30°ADJUSTABLE COMFORTABLE HANDLE] This XDOVET leaf blower with an 30° adjustable handle, which is in line with human mechanics. You can adjust the handle holding angle as you need to make your arm more comfortable even use it for a long time. 👍[6-SPEED ADJUSTABLE DESIGN] This XDOVET has a speed regulator near the handle, you can easily choose 6 different speeds just by turning the speed adjust gear. With 6000-18000RPM no-load speed, you can use this cordless leaf blower in different scenes such as sweeping your lawn leaves, sweeping your car dust, sweeping the yard snow or other sweep work. 👍[2000mAh RECHARGEABLE LI-ION BATTERY] This XDOVET cordless leaf blower is powered by a 20V 2000mA Li-ion battery. The battery is rechargeable, energy saving and environmental friendly, you can also save more money. It can last for about 15-45minutes due to different speeds, enough for all kinds of sweep works. 👍[COMPACT PORTABLE DESIGN] With only 3.78lbs lightweight, this XDOVET cordless leaf blower can be easily picked up with one hand, compact and portable design make this leaf blower comfortable for all people even elderly and children. You can also uninstall the battery and the blower tubes to storage with little space after use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oYsnR-tkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XDOVET","source_asin":"B097SJR9VX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097SJR9VX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097SJR9VX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
