window.products.push({"id":535657,"name":"STARUBY Coasters for Drinks 12 pcs Absorbent Cork Coasters with Flower Pattern Housewarming Gifts for New Home Present for Friends, Living Room Decor,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xe0iiIIdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why do you need coasters? Coasters protect your furniture and other surfaces from water marks and stains, water rings and spills, such as dining room tables, coffee tables, mini bars or end tables.  They also help prevent condensation from forming on the surface of the glasses, which can lead to a slippery surface when trying to pick up your drink. Coaster can be a decorative element that adds to the décor of your living space. Funny coasters will make a wonderful surprise for weddings, anniversaries, birthdays, and housewarming parties.  Why do you need our coasters? Good Material:  Cork material is not easy to deformation, lighter, easy to carry, outdoor use is also very convenient, more than other hard material is not easy to break. Cork material is environmental protection material, compared with rubber and other materials more environmental protection, is the best choice of the odor sensitive people. The protective film on the surface of the cork coaster will make it more durable, and will not penetrate liquids such as drinks into the furniture. This feature is more practical than fabric coasters, and will not produce ugly spots due to moisture. The Size of Coaster:  If you have a large or medium table, you will want to protect your surfaces. 4 inches, are just the right size for your drinks and tables.  Color Matching:  The matching of colors is particularly important in furniture. The black pattern on the surface of our coasters and the background color of natural cork make it more harmonious with any home decoration. Tips: What we need to pay attention to is that cork coaster retains ring marks and stains from dark liquids, like red wine. To remove stains from cork coasters, just scrub dish soap onto the stain and rinse.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xe0iiIIdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Staruby","source_asin":"B0BL27J25Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL27J25Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL27J25Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
