window.products.push({"id":535687,"name":"Vicks Dual Comfort – Cool + Warm Mist Humidifier (VWC775) – Warm and Cool Mist Humidifier with Fusion Mist Technology and Heated Medicine Cup, for Yea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wxnpxwFwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Vicks Dual Comfort – Cool + Warm Mist Humidifier fills your air with refreshing moisture to help provide temporary relief from cough and congestion, relieve dry air discomforts and also lets you choose and customize your comfort. It is a cool mist humidifier and a warm mist humidifier, giving you the flexibility to choose your temperature based on personal preference or as weather changes.  Fusion Mist Technology boils water and fuses it with cool mist to generate the ideal warm mist temperature. During cold and flu season, when pollen season kicks in, or the air is simply just dry, you can rely on this medium humidifier for your entire family.   It accepts two soothing Vicks VapoPads, has a heated medicine cup to create a medicated mist, and essential oils can be added to the medicine cup for relaxation and aromatherapy (oils not included). It also has no filter to change, and has dual mist outlets that let you direct the mist to wherever you need it most. Both mist temperatures add necessary moisture to the air, and help ensure proper humidity levels in your home. Indoor humidity levels between 40-60% can help relieve cough and congestion, keep throat and nasal passages hydrated, temporarily relieve dry air discomfort, protect furniture, reduce static electricity and even keep plants healthier. At Vicks, we believe that everyone deserves a touch of care. Vicks is the #1 brand recommended by Pediatricians.* Our line of humidifiers, steam inhalers and vaporizers help you breathe better and sleep more comfortably, wherever you are. *Based on a March 2020 survey of Pediatricians conducted by Arendt Consulting, of those Pediatricians who recommend humidifiers, Vicks brand humidifiers are the most often recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wxnpxwFwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vicks","source_asin":"B097NJK4RN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097NJK4RN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097NJK4RN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
