window.products.push({"id":535725,"name":"Regular/Standar Opening Mason Jar Lotion/Soap dispenser - Double Black Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iKe9TdUGL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Convert any regular canning jar and add some elegance with this high quality lotion or soap dispenser converter. These one piece tops and lids and fits regular jars (2.5\" rim - lids are 2-3/4\" in diameter). Black pumps have 9.85\" dip tube. Unlock the pump and cut the tube to fit if needed. See other listings to choose from single (1 dispenser), double (2 dispensers) or triple packs (3 dispensers) to match your kitchen, bath, mud room, garage or camper or get. Make sure to fill jar to leave at least a 1\" air space at the top. Do not let water, lotion or soap touch the under the lid. You need to keep it dry. These will come in 2 pieces and you will need to assemble the pump to the top (screw on top). **These will not work on jars that grocery store sauces come in** ** Jar not included used for display purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iKe9TdUGL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Homemade","source_asin":"B01DX825K8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DX825K8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DX825K8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
