window.products.push({"id":535744,"name":"Kanwone Porcelain Bowl Set - 34 Ounce for Cereal, Salad and Soup - Set of 4, Grey, Microwave and Dishwasher Safe Bowls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UVYefj7yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT SIZE FOR MULTI-PURPOSE - With a generous 34 oz capacity, these serving bowls are large and deep enough for cereal, dessert, fruit, salads, snacks, ramen and soup without splashed out. Great for everyday meals at home, parties and picnic. Each bowl measures 6.2\" Dia. x 3\" H. MODERN LOOK WITH 3D VERTICAL STRIPES DESIGN - This series uses the traditional common round bowl type, and has made a break through design on the texture. Each big bowl is surrounded by the solid 3D vertical stripes, which adds an elegant touch on your table. The user-friendly design will also make you easy to hold HOT and COLD items in your hand. PRO-GRADE PORCELAIN - These Kanwone cereal bowls are made of durable porcelain, LEAD-FREE and NON-TOXIC, chip-resistant. Microwave, oven, dishwasher, and freezer safe. Sturdy and durable enough for years of use. STACKABLE & EASY TO CLEAN - These soup bowls will stack nicely in the cabinet and save you on space. They are very easy to clean, you can wash them with soap and hot water or place them into your dishwasher. No residue left, no need to worry about stains. The gloss still looks like new after long time use. BEST GIFT OPTION - With both visually appealing and practical, this Kanwone Bowl Set is a perfect gift for your friends and family on Housewarming, Birthday party, Mothers' Day, Christmas, or any other special occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UVYefj7yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kanwone","source_asin":"B089CVVH2T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089CVVH2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089CVVH2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
