window.products.push({"id":535773,"name":"Sggvecsy Fall Gnome Autumn Gnomes Plush Handmade Thanksgiving Decorations Scandinavian Tomte Nisse Swedish Elf Dwarf for Thanksgiving Day Gift Harvest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816oQMjhekL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPECIAL DESIGN: We put classic elements of fall into the gnomes by color and design,such as buffalo plaid, punmkin, autumn leaves, sunflower, nuts pattern and red berries.The color with yellow and green combination is full of fall atmosphere, easy to create a chic of holiday touch. Add this adorable fall gnome for a bright and colorful compliment to your autumntime centerpieces. PACKAGE & SUITABLE SIZE: You will get 2 pieces of fall gnomes with different colors. Inside the gnome hat is adjustable iron wire, the gnome hat is bend to fix the box. Please expand the hat and adjust into original shape. The total height is approx 13.4 inch, the width is about 4 inch which is a proper size to fit any place and big enough to catch everybody's eyes! PREMIUM MATERIAL: These autumn gnomes plush are made of soft felt, wooden nose and fiber beard, which is durable and stable with soft comfortable touch, ables to use several festival seasons. At the bottom of the gnome is filled with sand to make it standing steadily. IDEAL GIFT CHOICE: The handmade thanksgiving decoration is a great gift for Harvest decoration, the Scandinavian tomte nisse brings good luck to families and is regarded as good luck. We can easily take this lucky to our best friends, children, lover, parents. Can also be used as collectible housewarming gifts. WIDELY APPLICATION: The swedish elf are adorable additions for you to decorate your home and room, like bookshelf, table, sofa, bed cabinets,bookcase, shelf and dining table for Thanksgiving, fall, autumn, Harvest, holiday, festival decoration. Children like the appearance mostly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816oQMjhekL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sggvecsy","source_asin":"B0B63SK4FV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B63SK4FV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B63SK4FV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":535774,"name":"Abbey Press (Abbey & CA Gift) A Sip of Soup & Prayer Grandma Soup Mug, 16 oz, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Vtw4l47TL._AC_.jpg","description":"Abbey Press 16 oz \"A Sip of Soup & Prayer\" Grandma Soup Mug. Mugs are crafted of oven/microwave/dishwasher safe stoneware and sized to hold a generous serving of soup or other hot treat. Each includes a matching lid that can also be used as a coaster. 16 oz.; 4 3/8\" x 3 1/2\". A Prayer for GRANDMA Dear God, bless this GRANDMA with smiles and joy to spare, And keep her always covered in Your tender, loving care. How can we thank God enough for you? -1 Thessalonians 3:9.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Vtw4l47TL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Abbey Press","source_asin":"B00LLHLIBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LLHLIBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LLHLIBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":535775,"name":"Silvermark Fat Mat Gel-Filled 20-Inch by 36-Inch Anti-Fatigue Mat, Hazelnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jws4fEjDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Instantly feel the soothing relief of the Silvermark Fat Mat Gel-Filled Anti-Fatigue Mat in Hazelnut. Filled with a shock-absorbing gel, the anti-fatigue mat is designed to reduce the stress on feet, legs, and back caused by standing in place for an extended period. The mat is ideal for prepping, cooking, washing dishes, ironing and folding laundry, or any task that requires extended standing. Gel is more durable than conventional foam filling and provides maximum forgiveness. This mat measures 20-inch by 36-inch and is available in Espresso, Hazelnut, and Chestnut.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jws4fEjDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silvermark","source_asin":"B003YC2IXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003YC2IXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003YC2IXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":535776,"name":"White Persian Cat Glass Christmas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.36,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nYzDxjObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4.25 Inches Tall x 2.5 Inches Wide  108 mm x 64 mm Glass Hand Painted Mouth Blown Real Bow Gift Boxed Animal-themed ornaments are a popular choice for Christmas decorations. From glass puppies and kittens to hand-painted deer and bears, there is an ornament to suit every taste. Animal lovers will appreciate the wide selection of animal-themed ornaments available and the fact that they can show off their love of animals during the holiday season. While Christmas is a time for family and friends, it is also a time to show your love for the animal kingdom. So whether you choose a hand-painted bear or puppy, make sure to include an animal-themed ornament on your Christmas tree this year. Each of our ornaments is meticulously crafted by hand using traditional techniques that originated in the 1800's. The Renaissance-era carving, molding, glass blowing, silver lining, painting and finishing processes require unparalleled skill and several weeks to complete. The molten glass is mouth-blown into finely carved molds to shape the ornament. It is then painted and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve the beautiful final products. Exquisite workmanship and details are the hallmark of all BestPysanky ornaments. We aim to bring warmth, color, spirit and sparkle into your home with our unique decor, as you admire and celebrate the holidays with your loved ones. It's more than just an ornament- it's a work of art!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nYzDxjObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B01G9NUOAW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-535776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G9NUOAW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G9NUOAW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
